              <g clip-path="url(#vclip)">
                <rect class="vwater" x="120" y="300" width="280" height="220"/>
                <path class="band" d="M140 236H396M140 268H396M140 252q8 -9 16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0t16 0"/>
              </g>
              <path class="voutline" d="M226 92H294C294 100 290 104 286 106C283 124 282 140 286 156C334 172 374 208 376 262C378 334 344 412 302 466L314 494H206L218 466C176 412 142 334 144 262C146 208 186 172 234 156C238 140 237 124 234 106C230 104 226 100 226 92Z"/>
            </g>
            <path class="stream" d="M436 190C470 216 486 400 478 620" pathLength="1"/>
            <text class="vcap" x="260" y="604" text-anchor="middle">AQUARIUS &#183; THE WATER-BEARER</text>
          </svg>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step is-active" data-step="1"><div class="card"><p>Luke 12 says what's whispered in closets will be shouted from the housetops. A few verses later: &#8220;the very hairs of your head are all numbered. Fear not.&#8221;</p></div></div>
        <div class="step" data-step="2"><div class="card"><p>Total knowledge, paired with total worth. The index will number every hair on your head with all the love of a spreadsheet. The love part was always our job.</p></div></div>
        <div class="step" data-step="3"><div class="card"><p>Meet your neighbors now, before things get cataclysmic.</p></div></div>
        <div class="step" data-step="4"><div class="card"><p>This is the age of Aquarius. The vessel tips, and everything it ever held comes pouring out.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

